Figure[0-9]*
*.docx
CURRENT_MANUSCRIPT.md
EXPERIMENT_REPRODUCIBILITY_NOTE.md
OPEN_SOURCE_COPY_CHECKLIST.md
*_AUDIT*.md
PLATFORM_MAIN_INTEGRATION_*.md
